It should be quite a bit better that a 3000/300.

FWIW, you probably want to take freebsd-alpha off your CC list for
issues with this machine.  We don't support the SCSI contoller or the
graphics / keyboard console on turbochannel machines.  NetBSD does a
far better job of device support on these boxes.

